  "slug": "please-apologize-for-your-compliment",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/4354_please-apologize-for-your-compliment.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Once, a friend went to a professor's home as a guest. The professor has a five-year-old daughter who is very beautiful. The friend said to the little girl: \"You are so beautiful.\" and gave her the gift he had brought. The little girl smiled politely and said, \"Thank you.\" After the professor waited for his daughter to leave, he said to his friend seriously: \"Please apologize for the compliment you just gave.\"",
    "The friend was surprised, but the professor continued: \"If you praise the child for her beauty, the child will probably regard her natural beauty as something she can be proud of. This is a wrong guide. But you still have a chance to make up for it. You can praise her smile and politeness, which are the result of her own efforts.\" Later, the friend formally apologized to the professor's youngest daughter and praised her politeness.",
    "Praise for children's appearance needs to be cautious, because from the perspective of their growth, praise for their good behavior is more important."
  ],
  "english_full": "Once, a friend went to a professor's home as a guest. The professor has a five-year-old daughter who is very beautiful. The friend said to the little girl: \"You are so beautiful.\" and gave her the gift he had brought. The little girl smiled politely and said, \"Thank you.\" After the professor waited for his daughter to leave, he said to his friend seriously: \"Please apologize for the compliment you just gave.\"\n\nThe friend was surprised, but the professor continued: \"If you praise the child for her beauty, the child will probably regard her natural beauty as something she can be proud of. This is a wrong guide. But you still have a chance to make up for it. You can praise her smile and politeness, which are the result of her own efforts.\" Later, the friend formally apologized to the professor's youngest daughter and praised her politeness.\n\nPraise for children's appearance needs to be cautious, because from the perspective of their growth, praise for their good behavior is more important.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Одна́жды друг пришёл в го́сть к профе́ссору. У профе́ссора есть пя́тилетняя до́чка, которая са́мая краси́вая. Друг ска́зал де́вочке: \"Ты о́чень краси́вая\" и пода́л ей пода́рок, который принёс. Де́вочка вежливо улы́бнулась и ска́зала: \"Спаси́бо\". По́сле того, как профе́ссор дождался, пока его до́чка уйдёт, он серьёзно ска́зает другу: \"Бу́дь добр, извини́сь за комплиме́нт, который ты то́лько что ска́зал.\"",
    "Друг был изумлён, но профе́ссор продолжа́л: \"Если ты хвали́шь де́тку за её кра́соту, де́тка, вероя́тно, начнёт счи́тать свою́ есте́ственную кра́соту чем-то, чем она мо́жет горди́ться. Это не́правильный проводни́к. Но у тебя всё ещё есть шанс возмести́ть. Ты мо́жешь хвали́ть её улы́бку и ве́жливость, которые являются ре́зультатом её собстве́нных стара́ний.\" По́зже друг формально извини́лся перед мла́дшей до́чкой профе́ссора и похвали́л её ве́жливость.",
    "Хвала́ за появле́ние де́тей нужда́ется в осмотри́тельности, потому что с то́чки зрения их разви́тия хвала́ за их хорошее поведе́ние ва́жнее."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Odnázhdy drug prishyól v góst' k prófessoru. U prófessora yest' píatiletnyaya dóchka, kotoraya sámaya krásirvaya. Drug skazál dévochke: \"Ty óchen' krásivaya\" i podál yey podárok, kotoryy prinos. Dévochka vézhlivo ulýbnulas' i skazála: \"Spasíbo\". Pósle tógo, kak prófessor dozhdálsya, poka yego dóchka uydyot, on seryózno skazál drugú: \"Bud' dor, izvinís' za komplimént, kotoryy ty tólkó chto skazál.\"",
    "Drug byl izumlyón, no prófessor prodolzhál: \"Eslí ty khvalíš' détku za yeyó krásotu, détka, veroyátnо, nachnót schitat' svoyu yestestvennuyu krásotu chemtó, chem ona móghet gordit'sya. Éto népravil'nyy provodník. No u tebya vsyo yeshcho yest' shans vozmestít'. Ty mózhesh khvalít' yey ulýbku i vézhlivost', kotorye yavlyayutsya rézultatom yey sobstvennykh starániy.\" Pozhzhe drug formál'no izvinílsya pered mládshyey dóchkoy prófessora i pokhvalíl yey vézhlivost'.",
    "Khvalá za poyavlenie détey nuzhdáetsya v osmotritel'nosti, potomu chto s tóchki zreniya ikh razvitiya khvalá za ikh khoróshye povedéniye vázhnee."
  ],
